    "created_at": "2017-12-05T10:16:12Z",
    "updated_at": "2017-12-05T10:16:12Z",
    "body": "The main reason is that browsers all have these lists/checks internally already and are therefore begging to be exposed in some manner. I'm happy to hold off on this though until all browsers and Node.js have shipped the basic API and we got some experience with that. No need to rush things especially given none of this has been exposed thus far (or cleaned up).",
